      "paragraph_number": 50,
      "text": "Each Experiment Data record contains raw data and multiple image sets. Associated raw data documents and individual image sets are located on the “Scientific Data and Information” tab within the Experiment Data record. The raw data is captured from each experimental sensor and presented in excel files. The suite of experimental sensors used is summarized in Table 3. ",
      "style": null,
      "figure_table_references": []
    },
    {
