      "text": "Table 3. Saffire, I, II and III Diagnostics",
      "style": null,
      "figure_table_references": [
        "Table 3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_number": 55,
      "text": "Table 4 contains a description of the different SAFFIRE image sets loaded in PSI.",
